#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Horizon Settings — the friendly control panel of @DISTRO_NAME@.

One place for the things people change most: light/dark mode, accent colour,
the dock, panel layouts, window buttons and animations. Everything is applied
live through Plasma's own tools and D-Bus APIs, so System Settings stays in
sync and nothing here is a hack that breaks on upgrade.

    horizon-settings                 open the app
    horizon-settings --page dock     open a specific page
    horizon-settings --welcome       autostart entry: show the welcome page once
"""

